            "notes": "Round 1: Credit Farming Strategy\nIn the first round, prioritize farming credits to unlock critical items and powers that enhance your build\u2019s potential. To maximize efficiency, avoid triggering Overheat when positioned far from enemies. Instead, advance toward the enemy tank and activate Overheat in close proximity to ignite them, securing both burn damage and optimal credit accumulation. Reserve defensive abilities, such as Fortify, for this moment to mitigate incoming damage if you push too far forward, ensuring you remain protected while applying pressure.\n\nRecommended Purchases (Round 1):\n\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)  (Weapon): \n \n[Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318)  (Ability):\n\n[Field Rations](item_46ae6709-1166-426f-bca3-97a538d3f089) (Survivability):",
