            "notes": "Round 2: Continued Credit Farming and Item Purchases\n\nContinue the same credit-farming strategy as Round 1, focusing on positioning near the enemy tank to trigger Overheat and ignite them for maximum credit gains and burn damage. Use Fortify strategically to avoid taking heavy damage when advancing. In Round 2, prioritize purchasing the following blue items to enhance your AOE capabilities, and acquire optional items if your credit reserves allow.\n\nRound 2 Required Purchases:\n\n [Electro Lights](item_d4ac5963-81ea-41b8-bc26-71905fadf860) (Ability): \n\n [Solar Regenergy](item_b03b2c68-d3e3-413a-a9b8-3385149ba9b8) (Ability): \n\nRound 2 Optional Purchases (if affordable):\n\n[Siphonic Spear](item_82c46448-08f2-4664-842c-c04d3120369a)  (Weapon): \n\n[Charged Chassis](item_b2307dff-5e70-4c77-bae2-2b0c2883c5bb)  (Survivability): \n\n[Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318)  (Ability):\n\n[Field Rations](item_46ae6709-1166-426f-bca3-97a538d3f089)  (Survivability): \n\n[Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0)  (Weapon):",
