            "notes": "Round 3: Unleashing the Inferno with Hot Rotate-O\n\nRound 3 is where the build becomes a fiery spectacle. The  [Hot Rotate-O](item_a9653a57-f50f-459a-95be-70a3ef13d3d4)  power infuses Javelin Spin with Heat, enabling Overheat every 5 seconds for consistent, devastating AOE burn damage. Continue the credit-farming strategy by positioning near the enemy tank to ignite them, maximizing credits and damage. Use Fortify strategically to protect yourself during aggressive pushes into the enemy backline.\n\nRound 3 Recommended Power:\n\n [Hot Rotate-O](item_a9653a57-f50f-459a-95be-70a3ef13d3d4)  (Power): \n\n [Electro Lights](item_d4ac5963-81ea-41b8-bc26-71905fadf860)  (Ability): \n\nRound 3 Item Purchases:\n\nIdeal Purchase:  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98)  (Survivability):\n\nFallback Purchases (if  [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98)  is unaffordable):\n\n [Charged Chassis](item_b2307dff-5e70-4c77-bae2-2b0c2883c5bb)  (Survivability): \n\n [Elite Rotator Cuff](item_dfba3349-64b8-4386-8eaf-15bcd1ca6b37)  (Ability): \n\n [Siphonic Spear](item_82c46448-08f2-4664-842c-c04d3120369a)  (Weapon): \n\n [Field Rations](item_46ae6709-1166-426f-bca3-97a538d3f089)  (Survivability): \n\n [Plasma Converter](item_25869f9a-9a29-4e19-96b6-9d8a28c59318)  (Ability): \n\nRound 3 Strategy Note: With  [Hot Rotate-O](item_a9653a57-f50f-459a-95be-70a3ef13d3d4), Javelin Spin becomes a fiery whirlwind, triggering Overheat every 5 seconds. Farm credits near the enemy tank, then push into the backline to ignite DPS and Supports.",
